spans.s:
प्रति-√ वच् P. -वक्ति, to announce, indicate, recommend, RV. i, 41, 4 (Ā. Subj. aor. -वोचे);
to speak back, answer, reply (also with 2 acc.), VS. &c. &c.;
to refute, Śaṃk.

प्रति-√ वद् P. -वदति, to speak to (acc.), RV.; Kauś.;
to speak back, answer, reply to (acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to repeat, KaṭhUp.; MBh. :
Intens. p. -वावदत् (mfn.) contradicting, AitBr.

प्रति-√ वप् P. -वपति, to insert (jewels &c.), set or stud with (instr.), Ragh.;
to fill up, ĀśvŚr.;
to add, TBr.

प्रति-√ वस् P. -वसति (ep. also Ā. ˚ते), to live, dwell, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -वसयति, to cause to dwell, settle, RV.;
to lodge, receive as a guest, MBh.

प्रति-√ वह् P. -वहति, to lead or draw towards, RV.; Hariv.;
to oppose, Divyāv. :
Caus. -वाहयति, to carry along, MBh.

प्रति-√ विद् P. -वेत्ति, to perceive, understand, RV. :
Caus. -वेदयति, to make known, report, announce (also with 2 acc.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to offer, present, RV.; AV.; MBh. &c.

प्रति-√ विद् P. Ā. -विन्दति, ˚ते, to find in addition, Br.;
 (Ā. p. -विदान) to be opposite to (acc.), ŚBr.;
to become acquainted with (acc.), MBh.

प्रति-वि-√ धा P. Ā. -दधाति, -धत्ते, to dispose, arrange, prepare, make ready, R.;
to despatch (spies), ib.;
to counteract, act against (gen.), Kād.;
to contradict a conclusion, Śaṃk.
